    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We are evaluating using Renjin for running “R” code. I do see below error while running the code. This code runs fine on the R-Studio.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Error: &#39;function&#39; of lang expression is of unsupported type &#39;NULL&#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On browsing the API, I can see this in error on the “proto” package.\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://packages.renjin.org/packages/proto.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://packages.renjin.org/packages/proto.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793344195406000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LwssuLjtEPwcgN7-o2yCS\">http://packages.renjin.org/packages/proto.html</a><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; cat(&quot;parent\\n&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">parent<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">NULL<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; oop &lt;- proto(x = 10, view = function(.) paste(&quot;this is a:&quot;, .$x))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; oop$ls()<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">ERROR: &#39;function&#39; of lang expression is of unsupported type &#39;NULL&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Is there any workaround or any way to handle this error? I am more of Java Programmer.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Regards,<br>\r\nVenkat<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fMI58yJz0-MJ",
   "from": "Kallen, Maarten-Jan",
