\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">parent<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">NULL<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; oop &lt;- proto(x = 10, view = function(.) paste(&quot;this is a:&quot;, .$x))<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">&gt; oop$ls()<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.5pt;line-height:15.0pt;background:whitesmoke;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Consolas;color:#333333\">ERROR: &#39;function&#39; of lang expression is of unsupported type &#39;NULL&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Is there any workaround or any way to handle this error? I am more of Java Programmer.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Regards,<br>\r\nVenkat<span><font color=\"#888888\"><u></u><u></u></font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
